<title>USA: Stanhome says to buy back up to 2.5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Stanhome says to buy back up to 2.5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>WESTFIELD, Mass. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stanhome Inc said Thursday that its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to 2.5 million shares of the company's outstanding common stock under its ongoing stock repurchase program.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the repurchased stock would be used for general corporate purposes or employee benefit plans.</p>
<p>It added that the share purchases will be made from time to time in the open market or in private transactions, depending on market and business conditions.</p>
</text>
